    value: Bus Stop
  - key: 8b2c6a3b7cc94999a15e057073153946:message:04b14243ca7145e3a5909b2a9c21ef6f:text
    value: Why would I go there?
  - key: 8b2c6a3b7cc94999a15e057073153946:message:1010b481e3574c9888cd339f51f5fe22:text
    value: I'm not letting it slide this time.
  - key: 8b2c6a3b7cc94999a15e057073153946:message:278d9c0584df4ce092c7eb3aa8ef8157:text
    value: Then how long are you going to keep avoiding it?
  - key: 8b2c6a3b7cc94999a15e057073153946:message:29df94d2ced0488ebb7a4c03ee578cea:text
    value: What?
  - key: 8b2c6a3b7cc94999a15e057073153946:message:2f7119679fd94c068f1d314f550ef17f:text
    value: 'Forget it.

      You''ll find out soon enough.'
  - key: 8b2c6a3b7cc94999a15e057073153946:message:3225f2f8057b4ba9aad0baa6ee2706b2:text
    value: You know what I'm talking about.
  - key: 8b2c6a3b7cc94999a15e057073153946:message:33223f94050e4b7a9e38a0581296baa2:text
    value: Forget it.
  - key: 8b2c6a3b7cc94999a15e057073153946:message:3d4605f60fc74d0cb1c474583c13d8d0:text
    value: Deleting it doesn't make it go away.
  - key: 8b2c6a3b7cc94999a15e057073153946:message:3f3cb9038ecc4acbb4101f414b2b0264:text
    value: What are you talking about all of a sudden?
  - key: 8b2c6a3b7cc94999a15e057073153946:message:4a624861dea14357b870297f6f198903:text
    value: 'Let''s talk here.

      Come if you''re coming.'
  - key: 8b2c6a3b7cc94999a15e057073153946:message:501f8bea59ed4e6ea427f7ab3c3986d1:text
    value: 'I honestly don''t even know what you''re talking about.

      Stop contacting me.'
  - key: 8b2c6a3b7cc94999a15e057073153946:message:57d79eafd3c74614a87fce23efe24a7c:text
    value: What is it?
  - key: 8b2c6a3b7cc94999a15e057073153946:message:5f338b0a6a424225850a0e78ed64eb6b:text
    value: I need to talk to you.
  - key: 8b2c6a3b7cc94999a15e057073153946:message:6279ef966e6240dda4a41af59354750b:text
    value: 'Why would I meet you?

      Stop following me.'
  - key: 8b2c6a3b7cc94999a15e057073153946:message:67fc76527e054c119ff072551ce81d1d:text
    value: 'I don''t know.

      And stop contacting me.'
  - key: 8b2c6a3b7cc94999a15e057073153946:message:6da1179d6e774fca9d2b4fe562df8025:text
    value: No.
  - key: 8b2c6a3b7cc94999a15e057073153946:message:6df8002851754ece8607ad46b76d2928:text
    value: Let's meet for a minute and talk.
  - key: 8b2c6a3b7cc94999a15e057073153946:message:775f8a80528c48eaadb49eec62ed5692:text
    value: Where did you see that?
  - key: 8b2c6a3b7cc94999a15e057073153946:message:7cd5d8aac3774c808c3ad792b57f1921:text
    value: Are you seriously going to keep pretending you don't know?
  - key: 8b2c6a3b7cc94999a15e057073153946:message:7d43dc8156f54cc58a243ccc0320520a:text
    value: Do you know how terrifying you are?
  - key: 8b2c6a3b7cc94999a15e057073153946:message:8caf4883778d4b45889486fe8f6b4abb:text
    value: Are you still going to deny it after seeing this?
  - key: 8b2c6a3b7cc94999a15e057073153946:message:9abd9651069d4a499bc6352182441ce9:text
    value: Found it.
  - key: 8b2c6a3b7cc94999a15e057073153946:message:aab421a5c825457191f03175c5fdd69b:text
    value: Fine. Keep doing that.
  - key: 8b2c6a3b7cc94999a15e057073153946:message:ac0cfd1bc4ee4eacab4d17a626aabb4b:text
    value: Come see it yourself.
  - key: 8b2c6a3b7cc94999a15e057073153946:message:b406f52451ce47b3bb2590e8ab3dd1c2:text
    value: What am I supposed to have deleted?
  - key: 8b2c6a3b7cc94999a15e057073153946:message:b4136f6ebb3a4470b94c40945b616511:text
    value: Okay.
  - key: 8b2c6a3b7cc94999a15e057073153946:message:b57ce5fed7874e7e81b7f833ba36cdb9:text
    value: Ask what?
  - key: 8b2c6a3b7cc94999a15e057073153946:message:d06e40cdb9a340b3bd02fc33d9129a7f:text
    value: 'What is wrong with you lately?

      If you keep this up, I''m reporting you.'
  - key: 8b2c6a3b7cc94999a15e057073153946:message:e3f8452687f040d59db340cb35ed6c1d:text
    value: I don't want to say it here.
  - key: 8b2c6a3b7cc94999a15e057073153946:message:e4fb33d84c264b86a820795b3822a91d:text
    value: What did you find?
  - key: 8b2c6a3b7cc94999a15e057073153946:message:eb320ff2978d42c0872e4c9927710115:text
    value: 'I just want to ask a few things.

      Answer me.'
  - key: 8b2c6a3b7cc94999a15e057073153946:message:f31df3c59d534c339a85195ce4942548:text
    value: ...
  - key: 8b2c6a3b7cc94999a15e057073153946:message:f44a0b5f33e94a458aa4ba0b596307a4:text
    value: I've checked almost everything.
  - key: 8b2c6a3b7cc94999a15e057073153946:message:fd9d47d27a8b4ad898073630b38208e1:text
    value: Where?
  - key: e7ff801140884941a9f3ac0fc5a62ad4:message:3ecd7bbb9e2f46cc89785d5dc533254c:text
    value: It was posted again. Different URL this time. They edited my photo to make it look like I was undressed, and wrote that I took it and sent it myself.
  - key: e7ff801140884941a9f3ac0fc5a62ad4:message:55360aa0b06f4c16a8c517df5c4425a6:text
    value: I just need to check a few more.
  - key: e7ff801140884941a9f3ac0fc5a62ad4:message:5a6441e50bbf4787a2f60d9e5cc13d65:text
    value: They said they can't look into it any further because the account is gone. You still have the screenshots, right?
  - key: e7ff801140884941a9f3ac0fc5a62ad4:message:5f6d7c36ae724352847360283fb385f1:text
    value: I said I don't want to. Let's just stop.
  - key: e7ff801140884941a9f3ac0fc5a62ad4:message:a3cf3c27fd0044178d4ffddcafdfe9e7:text
    value: I reported it, but I think they deleted it and made another account. They put my name and school on it too.
  - key: e7ff801140884941a9f3ac0fc5a62ad4:message:bb7d23e877094d228c61a706ace4684a:text
    value: You said you understood, but you keep looking.
  - key: e7ff801140884941a9f3ac0fc5a62ad4:message:c5553dd460f243cda2aa5c2e87c9a267:text
    value: You still have the screenshots and photos I sent before, right?
  - key: e7ff801140884941a9f3ac0fc5a62ad4:message:d1547d920da64275a86629c9b27061ae:text
    value: Just delete all the screenshots and photos. I don't even want you to have them.
  - key: e7ff801140884941a9f3ac0fc5a62ad4:message:d745590145454310a7cd12f084551fd7:text
    value: I'll screenshot this. Let's include it with the report.
  - key: e7ff801140884941a9f3ac0fc5a62ad4:message:d9524d457a5c46f98aeedbe8f66130c4:text
    value: I really don't want to talk about this anymore.
  - key: e7ff801140884941a9f3ac0fc5a62ad4:message:fd16a01c70494b1b835db2d9cb14bd4a:text
    value: Did they accept the last report too?
  - key: c084b1c48b3a4a83a4d7e439cacd4b05:message:048719005c074346b84d655d178f9c34:text
    value: I'll come over after I finish my assignment.
  - key: c084b1c48b3a4a83a4d7e439cacd4b05:message:b59a8517a51a49c0a3b460ddb13cae19:text
    value: Can you come over for dinner this weekend?
  - key: 5c5342e82614489ba1766a41b3f831bb:groupTitle
    value: Data Analysis Team Project
  - key: 5c5342e82614489ba1766a41b3f831bb:message:6464c50207184ef0a629a0d6eddd6b8a:text
    value: The presentation order changed. Check the materials.
  - key: 8d3edf77b4004b478a00f79139c2f579:message:f4d22bbc987b4cc88163e1e7335b734f:text
    value: Can you cover next Friday's shift?
  - key: 4c29f5583ec34b8cbf699725202710ed:message:8da304eee3d3423ba54db7e01fca0462:text
    value: The game got patched. Want to play this weekend?
  - key: eb423115cc3749fb9d70fb2caff98aca:message:2f8e7bf091ac4780b47e55350892a40e:text
    value: Can you walk with me to the main gate after class today?
  - key: eb423115cc3749fb9d70fb2caff98aca:message:529f9962c1e441aea8406b44d3d717c0:text
    value: Yeah. Text me when you're done.
  - key: eb423115cc3749fb9d70fb2caff98aca:message:5c82e60613454b4cafaca189cc23651e:text
    value: I think I saw the same person by the back gate today.
  - key: eb423115cc3749fb9d70fb2caff98aca:message:5e0b7dff58eb43fab56daadc37dae105:text
    value: I saw them again today. At the bus stop this time.
  - key: eb423115cc3749fb9d70fb2caff98aca:message:6ebf8aeca749427aa6ed9631c4a5c987:text
    value: What kind of person?
